    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last Updated: August 29, 2026</p>

    <p>Welcome to <strong>PDF Viewer Pro</strong>. Your privacy is our highest priority. This policy explains how we handle your information.</p>

    <h2>1. Data Collection & Privacy</h2>
    <p><span class="highlight">Offline-First Strategy:</span> We believe your documents are your business. PDF Viewer Pro is designed to work entirely offline.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>No File Uploads:</strong> Your PDF files, images, signatures, and watermarked documents are processed <strong>locally</strong> on your device. We never upload your content to any servers.</li>
        <li><strong>No Personal Data:</strong> We do not collect names, email addresses, or phone numbers.</li>
        <li><strong>No Tracking:</strong> We do not use cookies or tracking pixels to monitor your behavior.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Permissions Used</h2>
    <p>To provide a professional experience, the app requires specific system permissions:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Storage/Media Access:</strong> Used exclusively to read the PDFs you select and to save your generated files (Merged PDFs, Converted Images, etc.) into the <code>/PDFViewer</code> folder.</li>
        <li><strong>Camera:</strong> Used only when you utilize the "Scan PDF" feature to capture document images.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>We use a limited number of trusted Google services to ensure app stability and advanced features:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>ML Kit (Google):</strong> Used locally for high-precision document scanning.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Play Services:</strong> Used for secure "Force Update" checks and processing App Store interactions.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>Because your data never leaves your device, it is protected by your Android system's security. We recommend keeping your device updated and using a secure screen lock.</p>

    <h2>5. Ethics & Transparency</h2>
    <p>PDF Viewer Pro is built with an <strong>Ethical Development</strong> philosophy. We do not include intrusive advertisements or hidden "data mining" components. Our goal is to provide a clean, high-precision tool for the community.</p>

